<h2>Eighth Note Strumming</h2>
<p>When playing eighth notes, alternate downstrokes with upstrokes.&nbsp; P=
lay the downstrokes when you tap your foot.&nbsp; The upstrokes should be p=
layed when your foot is half-way between taps.&nbsp; This means you play do=
wnstrokes on the beat and upstrokes on the =E2=80=9Cand=E2=80=9D of each be=
at.</p>
