<h2>Sixteenth Note Strumming</h2>
<p>Sixteenth notes are played by alternating downstrokes with upstrokes, bu=
t they are played twice as fast as eighth notes.&nbsp; Downstrokes are play=
ed on the beat and the =E2=80=9Cands=E2=80=9D of the beats.&nbsp; Upstrokes=
 are played on the =E2=80=9Ce=E2=80=9D and =E2=80=9Ca=E2=80=9D parts of the=
 beat.</p>
