<h2>Alternate Picking</h2>
<p>If you=E2=80=99re a beginner, you=E2=80=99ll start by playing every note=
 with a down stroke. &nbsp;This is normal, but soon you=E2=80=99ll want to =
play faster. &nbsp;Alternate picking is one of the most efficient ways to p=
lay fast because you alternate between plucking down and plucking up.</p>
